":"College Football","kind":"recap","headline":"Harris, Holman rushing attack helps Wyoming fight off UNLV in 41-35 win","desc":"Samuel Harris ran for 128 yards and two touchdowns and Wyoming held off UNLV's rally for a 41-35 win on Saturday night.","by":""},{"league":"College Football","kind":"recap","headline":"Thomas Castellanos throws 5 TD passes as No. 13 Texas Tech holds off West Virginia 53-48","desc":"Thomas Castellanos threw for a career-high five touchdowns, including the go-ahead score to Kenny Johnson with 2:44 remaining, and No.","by":""},{"league":"College Basketball","kind":"recap","headline":"Williams scores 18 as Seattle U defeats Portland State 79-60","desc":"Mason Williams and Will Heimbrodt scored 18 points apiece as Seattle University beat Portland State 79-60 on Saturday.","by":""},{"league":"College Basketball","kind":"recap","headline":"Majstorovic\u2019s 18 help Pepperdine beat Bethesda 116-43","desc":"Petar Majstorovic had 18 points in Pepperdine\u2019s 116-43 win against Bethesda on Saturday.","by":""},{"league":"College Basketball","kind":"recap","headline":"Tadjo scores 14, Santa Clara downs Sacramento State 83-77","desc":"Chris Tadjo had 14 points in Santa Clara\u2019s 83-77 victory over Sacramento State on Saturday.","by":""},{"league":"NHL","kind":"recap","headline":"Draisaitl scores twice, McDavid has 3 assists to extend streak and Oilers beat skidding Canucks 4-2","desc":"Leon Draisaitl had two goals and an assist, Connor McDavid added three more assists and the Edmonton Oilers beat the struggling Vancouver Canucks 4-2 on Saturday night.","by":""},{"league":"College Basketball","kind":"recap","headline":"Jester's 24 lead UC Irvine past San Jose State 91-79","desc":"Jovan Jester Jr. had 24 points in UC Irvine's 91-79 win over San Jose State on Saturday.","by":""},{"league":"NBA","kind":"recap","headline":"Victor Wembanyama scores 29 points in Spurs win over Blazers","desc":"Victor Wembanyama scored 29 points and led the San Antonio Spurs to a 125-103 blowout win over the Portland Trail Blazers on Saturday night.","by":""},{"league":"College Basketball","kind":"recap","headline":"Beath's 21 help UC San Diego take down Fresno State 81-65","desc":"Leo Beath had 21 points in UC San Diego's 81-65 win against Fresno State on Saturday.","by":""},{"league":"NHL","kind":"recap","headline":"Sidney Crosby takes sole possession of 6th on NHL scoring list in Penguins' 5-2 win over Kings","desc":"Sidney Crosby scored two goals while moving into sole possession of sixth place on the NHL\u2019s career scoring list, and the Pittsburgh Penguins snapped their four-game\u2026","by":""},{"league":"NBA","kind":"recap","headline":"Booker scores 24, Suns outlast Rockets 102-99 for 1st back-to-back wins of season","desc":"Devin Booker scored 24 points, including seven straight to break a late tie, and the Phoenix Suns held off the Houston Rockets 102-99 on Saturday night.","by":""},{"league":"NHL","kind":"recap","headline":"Blackwood makes 27 saves, Necas has 4 points, Avs beat Wings 4-0","desc":"Mackenzie Blackwood made 27 saves, Martin Necas had two goals and two assists and the Colorado Avalanche beat the Detroit Red Wings 4-0 on Saturday night.","by":""},{"league":"NBA","kind":"recap","headline":"Stephen Curry scores 41 points as Warriors win seventh straight, beating Magic 126-119 in overtime","desc":"Stephen Curry converted a three-point play with 1:38 left in overtime that put Golden State ahead then scored a layup in the final minute to finish with 41 points, six\u2026","by":""}],"features":[{"league":"NFL","kind":"story","headline":"Bengals' Burrow, Chase, Higgins add Spanish flair to TD celebrations in Madrid","desc":"The Bengals' first-half lead called for celebrations inspired by being in Spain.","by":"Ben Baby","who":"Joe Burrow","body":["MADRID \u2014 The Cincinnati Bengals made sure to bring some Spanish flair to Sunday's game against the Atlanta Falcons.","It was Cincinnati's big trio:Joe Burrow, Ja'Marr Chase and Tee Higgins who were the headliners on their respective touchdown celebrations. First, Chase and Higgins got things rolling after Chase hauled in a 47-yard touchdown pass from Burrow on Cincinnati's first offensive drive of the game.","Chase played the role of the matador, leaving Higgins to mimic a charging bull in Chase's direction. That drew big cheers from the crowd inside the historic Santiago Bernabeu, the home of Real Madrid.","Then one drive later after a quarterback sneak, it was Burrow's turn to pay homage to the venue. He got up and put his hands to the side of his helmet and wiggled them, a tribute to notable celebration of Brazilian soccer star Neymar Jr., who starred for years with Barcelona.","The NFL wanted to bring the Bengals and Falcons over to showcase some of the league's biggest stars. Along with Cincinnati's offensive trio, Atlanta running back Bijan Robinson drew some of the biggest cheers from the day.","And everyone who made it to the game on Sunday definitely got to witness one of the best shows in the league."]},{"league":"NBA","kind":"story","headline":"Making sense of Jaylen Brown's previous impact with Celtics","desc":"Ahead of the 76ers-Celtics game, we dive into the gap between Brown and on/off statistics.","by":"Zach Kram","who":"Jaylen Brown","body":["If the Dallas Mavericks' infamous trade of Luka Doncic produced waves of shock and outrage across the NBA, then the Boston Celtics' trade of Jaylen Brown a year later was met with considerably more complicated reactions.","Outrage, yes, from Celtics fans \u2014 but also a fierce debate about Brown's on-court value and broader questions about how to analyze players in the modern, data-infused NBA.","Brown is a five-time All-Star, a former Finals MVP and the sixth-place finisher in regular-season MVP voting in 2026, after he averaged a career-best 28.7 points per game. Yet, advanced stats were more skeptical of his stardom.","The Celtics had a better net rating with Brown off the court than on it in seven of his 10 seasons in Boston, including each of the last four. (All on/off data in this piece comes from Cleaning the Glass, which strips out garbage time.)","With Brown poised to play against his old team for the first time on Tuesday (8 p.m. ET, NBC/Peacock) \u2014 and with the NBA's best current rivalry poised to begin a new chapter \u2014 it's the perfect time for a deeper dive into what exactly the gap between Brown's reputation and advanced stats means, and how it contributed to the summer's blockbuster trade.","Given the statistics explosion in the NBA's ongoing information era, it's easy to access on/off numbers for every player in the league. Based on conversations with both public and team-side analysts, here's the best way to understand how to interpret them.","Jump to topic: The on/off basics Interpreting the use of on/off How on/off contributed to Brown's trade"]},{"league":"MLB","kind":"story","headline":"What Yankees, Mets can do this winter to meet their 2027 goals","desc":"The 2026 MLB season didn't go as either New York team planned. Here's how they can flip the script next year.","by":"Jorge Castillo","who":"Tarik Skubal","body":["With a lockout looming on Dec. 1, the consensus across Major League Baseball is that November will be a frenetic month, similar to the lead-up to the 2021 lockout. Free agents will come off the board. Trades will be made. There will be a flurry of player movement before the league shuts down.","The action, according to sources, is expected to start as soon as next week, when the industry convenes at the general managers meetings in Las Vegas. And you can expect the two New York clubs will be involved.","The Yankees and Mets experienced very different versions of disappointment in 2026. The Yankees reached the postseason for the eighth time in nine years under manager Aaron Boone, only to get bounced by an American League East rival in the division series for the second straight year.","The Mets, meanwhile, did not make the playoffs for the second consecutive season, finishing last in the National League East despite having one of baseball's two most expensive payrolls.","Both teams will dabble in the free agent and trade markets to bolster their rosters this offseason. Here are three needs we believe each team will address to get over the hump by the time Opening Day comes around \u2014 whenever that is.","1. Rebuild the bullpen (starting with closer David Bednar?)","Pitching was not the problem for the Yankees in 2026. They led the majors in staff ERA by a good margin. But while they have a surplus of starters, they'll need to fill out their bullpen again this offseason.","As it stands, left-hander Brent Headrick is the only reliever under team control for next season who had at least 17 appearances in 2026."]}]},"rankings":[{"league":"College Basketball","poll":"AP Top 25","rows":[{"n":1,"team":"Florida","abbr":"FLA","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":2,"team":"Duke","abbr":"DUKE","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":3,"team":"Illinois","abbr":"ILL","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":4,"team":"UConn","abbr":"CONN","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":5,"team":"Arizona","abbr":"ARIZ","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":6,"team":"Michigan St","abbr":"MSU","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":7,"team":"Texas","abbr":"TEX","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":8,"team":"Tennessee","abbr":"TENN","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":9,"team":"Virginia","abbr":"UVA","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":10,"team":"Houston","abbr":"HOU","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":11,"team":"Louisville","abbr":"LOU","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":12,"team":"Arkansas","abbr":"ARK","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":13,"team":"St John's","abbr":"SJU","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":14,"team":"Miami","abbr":"MIA","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":15,"team":"Gonzaga","abbr":"GONZ","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":16,"team":"Michigan","abbr":"MICH","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":17,"team":"Kansas","abbr":"KU","rec":"0-0","move":""},{"n":18,"team":"Iowa State","abbr":"ISU","rec":"0-0